  "about_colours": "Every colour is a colour answer in the planner / edit word language (copilot/colours.py): a name from its 147 colours, or {name, shade, look, see_through}, or {hex} for the hand-picked defaults. colours.material() turns it into the material, in the build script and in the add-on, so the user can recolour any slot with exactly the options the models use.",
