  "default_toy": "random",
  "about_toys": "The Maris always weaves a gold toy that is not finished yet; it floats beside the star on her wand (no thread ties them). A design picks one toy or a random mode; random picks a new toy each time she starts weaving (\"random\" from the outfit's toy_theme, \"random_any\" from all). Each toy object has maris_toy.",
