  "about_pose_parts": "Per pose: objects to hide, whether the toy shows (toy, default true) and whether the outfit's tool shows (tool, default false). Meshes with maris_pose (comma-separated pose names) show only in those poses: the seated skirt and shoes.",
  "sitting": {
    "lap_under": 0.1,
    "seat_height": 0.28,
    "about": "Seated (sit, sit_seat): the lap's underside is lap_under above her origin and her shoes reach seat_height below it, both at height 1.0. The add-on puts her origin at seat top - lap_under * scale and scales her so seat_height fits the seat."
